# MiraStack Agent Cron Schedule
# Copy this file and adjust paths and schedules to match your setup.
#
# Prerequisite: Claude Code CLI installed and authenticated.
# Each job runs `claude` in the project directory with the specified agent.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @planner — autonomous ticket executor (runs twice daily)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
0 2,14 * * * cd /path/to/your/project && claude --agent planner --print --output-format stream-json >> .claude/planner-cron.log 2>&1

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# @autoresearch — discovers opportunities and creates tickets (weekly)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
0 3 * * 1 cd /path/to/your/project && claude --agent autoresearch --print --output-format stream-json >> .claude/autoresearch-cron.log 2>&1

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# pull-analytics — refresh traffic data for agents (daily, early AM)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
0 1 * * * cd /path/to/your/project && node bin/pull-analytics.mjs >> .claude/analytics-cron.log 2>&1

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# daily-digest — email summary of site health and agent activity
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
0 8 * * * cd /path/to/your/project && node bin/daily-digest.mjs >> .claude/digest-cron.log 2>&1

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# sync-feedback — pull GitHub Issues into tkt (runs on SessionStart
# hook by default, but can also be cron'd for non-interactive sync)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*/30 * * * * cd /path/to/your/project && node bin/sync-feedback.mjs >> .claude/feedback-sync-cron.log 2>&1
